@byokit/accounts depends on @earendil-works/pi-ai (MIT), which provides the
providers' own sign-in flows. byokit does not modify or redistribute it.

byokit signs a person in to AI plans they already pay for, inside the app they
run it in. Some providers do not document that use; each one is labelled with
its terms status in packages/accounts/src/catalogue.json, and the app decides
what to offer. byokit never offers Claude plan sign-in, which Anthropic
reserves for its own apps.
